 # Java
 
-Contents: 1. Optional for a missing item
+Contents: 1. Optional for a missing item · 2. Methods of at most 15 lines
 
 ## 1. Optional for a missing item
 
 Return an Optional from a method that finds 1 item that can be missing, and never null. The caller then sees the missing case in the type and must handle it before it reads the item.
 
 - Limits: a field, a parameter and a collection are never an Optional.
+
+## 2. Methods of at most 15 lines
+
+Split a method into private methods as soon as its body passes 15 lines. A short method fits on 1 screen, so a reader sees all of it without scrolling.
